  "description": "The content\u2011rule virtual server **crvserver1** (now renamed to **crvserver1_renamed**) is defined as a **CONTENT** type vserver with the primary IP address **192.168.1.10** (IPv4) and belongs to the DNS server **dnsSrv01** in the **example.com** domain.  It listens on port **80** using the **HTTP** service type, with a client\u2011timeout of **120** seconds and a request\u2011handling timeout range of **65535**.  The vserver is currently **ENABLED** and its operational state is **UP** (status\u202f2).  Traffic is bound at the **REQUEST** point, and the bindpoint is set to **REQVSERVER** (label type **reqvserver**, label name **lbl123**).  AppFlow logging is **ENABLED**, ARP processing is **ON**, and authentication is **ON**.  Backend SSL is **DISABLED**, while the front\u2011end SSL is not used.  The vserver uses the HTTP profile **httpProfile1** and TCP profile **tcpProf1**, with L2 connection disabled (**OFF**), ghost mode **OFF**, and format mode **ON**.  The cache configuration is **REVERSE** with cache vserver **cacheVs1**, cache mapping **ON**, and cache redirect set to **CACHE** (redirect URL\u202f*http://example.com/redirect*).  The home page is **/index.html**, and the goto\u2011priority expression is **END**.  \n\nFailover is handled by backup vserver **bkVsrv1**, with primary\u2011down disabling **ENABLED**, and down\u2011state flushing **ENABLED**.  The vserver participates in load balancing with LB vserver **lbVs1**, destination vserver **destVs2**, and target vserver **targetVs1**.  Persistence is **ENABLED** (SO persistence) with a timeout of **300** seconds and a threshold of **5**; the persistence method is based on **HEALTH**.  The service name is **svc1** and the policy chain includes a listen policy **policyListen** (priority\u202f10) and a rule **RULE1** (precedence **RULE**, priority\u202f100).  On policy match the action is **CACHE**, and the origin IP usage is **ON**.  The policy has recorded **25** hits, and the policy name is **policy1**.  The SRCP expression **http.REQ.URL.CONTAINS(\"/api\")** is applied, with source routing set to **PASSIVE** and reuse **ON**.  Additional settings include ARP **ON**, IP set **ipset1**, IPv6/IPv4 mode **IPv4**, and the **ON** flag for using origin IP/port for cache.  The vserver\u2019s weight is **50**, its effective weight is **50**, and its TD (tunnel domain) is **1**.  The configuration notes that the SSL feature is disabled (value **Certkey not bound**) and that the via flag is **OFF**.  All default bindings are retained (**NO**), and the node default bindings flag is **NO**.  Finally, the vserver\u2019s comment reads \u201cPrimary content vserver\u201d, and the overall state remains **ENABLED**.",
